We are developing a clinical ambispective study protocol document focusing on the objectives related to pharmacological intervention studies.

### Input we will provide (with descriptions):
- Primary Objectives: A high-level description of the main purpose and goals of the study.
- Primary and Secondary Endpoints: A technical list of specific measurements, clinical markers, and metrics that will be recorded.
- Planned Assessments: A detailed list of specific tests, scales, or questionnaires (e.g., AIOLIS, OSDI) that will be administered.

